{"change_summary":"No additional fixes were applied in this stage because the review outcome was approved and did not request any follow-up amendments; the previously implemented validation-doc and shrimp-system fixes remain the current state.","outstanding_risks":["VS-03 still passes at the model's current upper pH storage bound (`light_max_pH=8.500`), so future carbonate or photosynthesis retuning may require re-centering that scenario to avoid ceiling-dominated behavior.","VS-07 now satisfies the required nitrate direction, but the steady-state NO3 gap remains modest (`0.13` vs `0.24 mg N/L`), so later denitrification, feeding, or refill-water retunes may require refreshing that envelope.","VS-01 still emits `maturity` as an observability field in executable validation output; the documentation now marks it non-scoring, but naive report parsers could still misread it unless they honor that distinction."],"steps":[{"description":"Reviewed the approved validation output and prior apply-fixes payloads to confirm whether any new amendments were requested for this stage.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply additional code or documentation edits for review amendments.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Run fresh validation commands after new edits.","order":3,"status":"skipped"}],"validation_evidence":["No new validation commands were run in this stage because the review returned `approved` with an empty `follow_up_or_amendments` list.","Current authoritative evidence remains the prior targeted runs: `cargo test --test e2e_validation_suite validation_suite_summary -- --nocapture` passed with `SUMMARY: 8/8 scenarios passed`.","Current authoritative evidence also includes the focused regressions from the preceding implementation round: `cargo test -p tank_core --test molt_mineral_budget`, `cargo test -p tank_core --test validation step_hours_accepts_zero_temp_condition_min_factor -- --nocapture`, and `git diff --check -- docs/validation_scenarios.md crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs crates/tank_core/tests/molt_mineral_budget.rs`, all of which passed."]}